title GET /api/v1/refund-reasons - contrato vigente

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Sales" as Sales #E2E8F0
participant "API devoluciones" as API #DBEAFE
database "PostgreSQL\nrefund_reasons" as DB #DCFCE7

Sales -[#2563EB]> API : GET /api/v1/refund-reasons

note over API #DBEAFE
  [CONTRATO]
  Sin filtros, paginación ni CRUD adicional.
end note

API -[#2563EB]> DB : SELECT id, name, description, lot_requirement\nWHERE is_active = TRUE\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY name, id

note over DB #DCFCE7
  [DDL]
  id, name, description,
  lot_requirement e is_active
  pertenecen a refund_reasons.
end note

DB -[#16A34A]> API : filas activas y no borradas
API -[#2563EB]> API : [APLICACIÓN] validar name 1..150,\ndescription 1..300 y mapear lotRequirement
API -[#2563EB]> Sales : 200 OK\n[{ id, name, description, lotRequirement }]

note over Sales,API #DBEAFE
  [CONTRATO]
  El orden estable es name, luego id.
end note
@enduml
